# Third-party notices

## TorrServer

This product bundles [TorrServer](https://github.com/YouROK/TorrServer) (YouROK),
licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

Binary is downloaded at Docker image build time from GitHub Releases
(`TorrServer-linux-amd64` / `TorrServer-linux-arm64`) and placed at
`/usr/local/bin/torrserver`. It is started on demand for torrent playback and
stopped when idle.

